  <TM_ManaSickness.label>法力反噬</TM_ManaSickness.label>
  <!--原中文: '法力反噬会影响法师,当他们没有法力时而且他们的法力再生为负时。法力反噬最终会杀死一个法师，如果它没有被逆转。玩家可以在魔法界面中评估法师的法力回复，同时将鼠标悬停在法力回复值上，会显示一个提示，显示影响法力回复的因素.', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Mana sickness affects mages when they have 0 mana and their regeneration is negative. Mana sickness will eventually kill a mage if it is not reversed. Players may evaluate a mage's mana regeneration in the Magic Tab while hovering over the Mana regeneration value to display a tooltip showing contributors affecting mana regeneration.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Mana sickness affects mages when they have 0 mana and their regeneration is negative. Mana sickness will eventually kill a mage if it is not reversed. Players may evaluate a mage's mana regeneration in the Magic Tab while hovering over the Mana regeneration value to display a tooltip showing contributors affecting mana regeneration.-->
  <TM_ManaSickness.description>法力反噬会影响法师,当他们没有法力时而且他们的法力再生为负时。法力反噬最终会杀死一个法师，如果它没有被逆转。玩家可以在魔法界面中评估法师的法力回复，同时将鼠标悬停在法力回复值上，会显示一个提示，显示影响法力回复的因素.</TM_ManaSickness.description>
